        </Box>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>从控制中心到现场设备，四层区域各有边界</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8 }}>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(231,129,114,0.28)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 9.5, color: '#E78172' }}>挑战</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.14)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.60)' }}>10 MIN</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 4, paddingBottom: 4, border: '1px solid rgba(107,200,209,0.28)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>TEACHING</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 18, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>LEARNING OBJECTIVES</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 理解控制中心、监控层、现场层与历史数据区的边界</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 识别 SCADA → Historian 主机级放行的影响</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 关闭直连并保持 HMI 监控与 SCADA 控制业务</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>WATCH FOR</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>HMI 是 seed；SCADA → Historian 的主机级规则显式放行；关闭后走 Default DENY，Historian 不再进入受影响状态。</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#E78172', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>TASK</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>保护 Historian 历史数据库，同时保持 HMI 监控画面与 SCADA 控制指令两条业务可达。</Text>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 7 }}>
